><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Avoid&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zlab</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Skills&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Title&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><span><br></span><p></p><div>However, I receive the following error when trying to do so: <div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cloud</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">formula</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> P </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Theta1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Theta2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Theta1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">  formal argument </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;xlab&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> matched </span><span style=\"color:#008\">by</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multiple actual arguments</span></div></div></code></div><br><br></div><div>I&#39;ve also tried including all of the itemplot() arguments and then passing in the additional arguments</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">itemplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">chaffect</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pre</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;trace&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> degrees </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">45</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> CE </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">CEalpha</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">CEdraws</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span